### Epistemic Articulacy — Mineral & Gemstone Terminology Architecture

Classification ID: EA-MGC-360 Domain: Mineralogy · Gemology · Crystallography · Chemistry · Optical Physics · Resource Management Purpose: Establish a scientifically articulated terminology system for identifying, classifying, comparing, and managing minerals and gemstones.

The following terminology is organized by scientific discipline, functional application, and resource classification.

