| OBS  | Observation        | Visually observed properties     |
| MEA  | Measurement        | Instrument-derived values        |
| CMP  | Composition        | Chemically established identity  |
| STR  | Structure          | Crystallographic evidence        |
| OPT  | Optical Evidence   | Measured light interaction       |
| INF  | Inference          | Reasoned interpretation          |
