| UNC  | Uncertainty        | Unresolved classification        |
| PRO  | Provenance         | Documented origin                |
| AUD  | Audit              | Historical examination           |

Evidence rule: A gemstone's visible color alone does not establish its mineral identity. Chemical, structural, and optical evidence must be evaluated independently.

